# ============================================================
# Seerah Q&A Bot — environment
# ============================================================
# The app runs offline-deterministic (zero-hallucination grounded
# answers) and works with NO API keys. The corpus is loaded at runtime
# from the spec-mandated live API (https://api.islamicdesk.com/api/seerathon/corpus),
# with the frozen snapshot data/corpus.snapshot.json as an automatic fallback.
#
# Optional — semantic (embedding) retrieval. When set, question meaning is
# used as an extra ranking signal on top of the deterministic BM25 pipeline.
# Without these the app simply skips semantic search and remains fully
# lexical. Vectors are precomputed into web/data/embeddings.json.
#
# LLM_API_KEY=your_google_ai_api_key
# LLM_BASE_URL=https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/openai/
# LLM_MODEL=gemini-3.5-flash-lite
# LLM_MODEL_FALLBACKS=gemini-2.5-flash-lite,gemini-3.5-flash-lite
# EMBEDDINGS_MODEL=gemini-embedding-001
# EMBEDDINGS_BASE_URL=https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta